    "updated_at": "2021-01-10T14:58:19Z",
    "body": "I think your bug is a duplicate of #585.\r\nDo you also hit this issue with long paths or lots of modules active in a directory without spaces?\r\n\r\nEnabling fish-style truncation in your prompt might help keep its size down:\r\n```toml\r\n[directory]\r\nfish_style_pwd_dir_length = 3\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
