    "updated_at": "2021-01-11T13:59:21Z",
    "body": "It looks like the fish style pwd only applies to the otherwise truncated part of the directory path, so it will actually make the path longer....\r\n\r\nInstead, setting `truncation_length` to `2` or `1` might help you keep the prompt short.\r\n\r\nAnyway, closing this because it's a duplicate.",
